    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111318" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλο-μμηδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
		epith. of Aphrodite in <i><span class="en">
			Hes.
			<u>Th.</u>
			200
		</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅτι μηδέων ἐξεφαάνθη</span>): acc. to
			<i><span class="en">
			Eust.
			439.36
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hes.
		</span></i> here <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν τοῦ Κρόνου μηδέων
			ἐτυμολογεῖ</span> as if 
			Boeot.
		: in later 
			Boeot.
		 (from about <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδ-</span> would be written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειδ-.</span></div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
